+ * clear the 29 low significand bits (truncation toward zero), narrow (exact). Lanes whose
+ * operands or result fall outside the ordinary range -- and fma lanes that rounded onto a
+ * 24-bit boundary -- are redone one by one (scalar fast path, else exact), as on arm64.
+ * The per-lane form costs four branchy lanes per op; Tekken 5 DR's sound core (FFT
+ * butterflies of fa/fs/fma) could not finish its 5.33 ms audio tick in time with it. */
+#include <smmintrin.h>
